      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u2022 /play: PlayView (manual play, FUN-*)\n\u2022 /autopilot: AutopilotView (bot runs)\n\u2022 stores: game, runs, preferences\n\u2022 session.applyGameEvent() (WEB-11)\n\u2022 BotServiceClient (REST + SSE)\n\u2022 injected: gameApi, botService, clock",
      "originalText": "\u2022 /play: PlayView (manual play, FUN-*)\n\u2022 /autopilot: AutopilotView (bot runs)\n\u2022 stores: game, runs, preferences\n\u2022 session.applyGameEvent() (WEB-11)\n\u2022 BotServiceClient (REST + SSE)\n\u2022 injected: gameApi, botService, clock",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
